        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Land TD</strong> combines classic tower-defense strategy with a dynamic card-based battle system across 60 challenging missions. Instead of building traditional attacking towers, you must protect a single central tower — your last line of defense — with nothing but its health standing between you and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon powerful heroes and even fearsome bosses by playing cards and dragging them directly onto the battlefield. Spend gold tokens that steadily regenerate up to a maximum, then make every move count. Build and customize your deck to unlock powerful abilities, call in reinforcements, and turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit unique characters, take on formidable enemy bosses, and experience visually striking battles packed with strategic choices. <strong>War Land TD</strong> delivers a fresh take on tower defense for fans of tactical card games and strategy alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203900/extras/296aa30fbb38214e87f524cf36fce519.avif?t=1787679992\" width=1024 height=500 /></span></p>",
